WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:15.464
The Kids Central campers were eating lunch outside.

2
00:00:16.464 --> 00:00:17.845
But Jason wasn't eating.

3
00:00:17.865 --> 00:00:20.205
"What's the matter, Jason?"

4
00:00:20.546 --> 00:00:21.626
Mr. Dunn asked.

5
00:00:22.626 --> 00:00:23.826
"You're not hungry today?"

6
00:00:23.846 --> 00:00:28.828
"I'm hungry," Jason said, poking at his zucchini.

7
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.982
"But I'm really sick of zucchini.

8
00:00:34.124 --> 00:00:35.945
We have a lot of it in our garden now.

9
00:00:38.247 --> 00:00:40.148
My mom makes me eat it every day!"

10
00:00:41.249 --> 00:00:42.710
Mr. Dunn looked shocked.

11
00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:46.654
"Really? You're sick of zucchini?"

12
00:00:46.674 --> 00:00:51.157
"I love zucchini," said Bobby.

13
00:00:51.177 --> 00:00:54.840
"It's not that bad," Izzie added.

14
00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.062
"Just eat it, Jason."

15
00:00:57.082 --> 00:01:00.192
"No wait—don't!"

16
00:01:01.233 --> 00:01:04.594
Mr. Dunn suddenly covered Jason's zucchini with his hand.

17
00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:07.055
Everyone stared at Mr.

18
00:01:07.095 --> 00:01:09.196
Dunn. "What's wrong?"

19
00:01:09.676 --> 00:01:10.516
asked Jason.

20
00:01:10.536 --> 00:01:13.678
"I just remembered," said Mr.

21
00:01:13.718 --> 00:01:19.000
Dunn. "We're making something today that might help you enjoy the zucchini!"

22
00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.561
Mr. Dunn started cleaning up his lunch.

23
00:01:24.222 --> 00:01:26.663
"I'm going to grab our supplies," he said.

24
00:01:26.683 --> 00:01:28.343
"Can I help?"

25
00:01:28.744 --> 00:01:29.704
Jason asked.

26
00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:34.483
"Sure. You can help me carry some things," Mr.

27
00:01:34.543 --> 00:01:35.203
Dunn said.

28
00:01:40.067 --> 00:01:41.028
In the gym Mr.

29
00:01:41.068 --> 00:01:42.389
Dunn picked up two bags.

30
00:01:45.031 --> 00:01:48.533
He pointed to the long extension cord and blender on the table.

31
00:01:48.553 --> 00:01:51.195
"Can you carry those things?"

32
00:01:51.676 --> 00:01:52.256
he asked.

33
00:01:52.276 --> 00:01:56.599
"Sure." Jason picked them up and followed Mr.

34
00:01:56.619 --> 00:01:57.460
Dunn outside.

35
00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:04.001
"We're going to make a magic dip," Mr.

36
00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:04.702
Dunn said.

37
00:02:04.722 --> 00:02:09.304
"It will help you eat zucchini and other vegetables you don't like."

38
00:02:10.404 --> 00:02:11.965
Ethan made a sour face.

39
00:02:12.965 --> 00:02:14.006
"Even cauliflower?"

40
00:02:14.406 --> 00:02:15.026
he asked.

41
00:02:15.046 --> 00:02:19.488
"Absolutely cauliflower," Mr.

42
00:02:19.528 --> 00:02:20.288
Dunn answered.

43
00:02:20.308 --> 00:02:22.629
"What's in the magic dip?"

44
00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:23.770
Ethan asked.

45
00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:27.892
"Jason, please show us what's in the grocery bag."

46
00:02:28.896 --> 00:02:30.918
Mr. Dunn set the bags on the table.

47
00:02:34.682 --> 00:02:39.286
oil and roasted almonds," Jason said, pulling two items out of the bag.

48
00:02:39.306 --> 00:02:42.729
"A lemon and garlic cloves."

49
00:02:42.749 --> 00:02:43.770
"That's it?"

50
00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:45.692
Ethan asked, surprised.

51
00:02:45.712 --> 00:02:48.114
"Nope," said Jason.

52
00:02:48.134 --> 00:02:50.196
"Here's salt and pepper too."

53
00:02:51.618 --> 00:02:53.639
"Boys," said Mr.

54
00:02:53.699 --> 00:02:58.887
Dunn, "can you squeeze the lemon to make three tablespoons of juice?

55
00:02:59.987 --> 00:03:03.710
Girls, can you measure one-third cup of olive oil?"

56
00:03:11.195 --> 00:03:12.936
Mr. Dunn plugged in the blender.

57
00:03:12.956 --> 00:03:18.740
"We can put in everything at once," he said.

58
00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:23.883
"Roasted almonds, garlic, lemon juice, and olive oil."

59
00:03:28.312 --> 00:03:32.135
Whrr! The blender hummed and spun.

60
00:03:32.155 --> 00:03:36.798
"Now let's add a little salt and pepper," said Mr.

61
00:03:36.838 --> 00:03:40.600
Dunn. "Nice and creamy," said Izzie.

62
00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:44.223
"Perfect for our dip," said Mr.

63
00:03:44.263 --> 00:03:49.346
Dunn. He spooned some dip onto a plate and handed it to Jason.

64
00:03:49.366 --> 00:03:52.989
"Now try your zucchini."

65
00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:57.232
Everyone watched Jason dip a zucchini stick into the dip.

66
00:04:03.312 --> 00:04:05.234
"Well?" Izzie burst out.

67
00:04:05.254 --> 00:04:06.875
"Do you like it?"

68
00:04:07.976 --> 00:04:10.878
Jason squeezed his eyes as he chewed the zucchini.

69
00:04:10.899 --> 00:04:14.361
"Yes!" he cried at last.

70
00:04:14.381 --> 00:04:16.023
"It's good.

71
00:04:16.803 --> 00:04:17.404
Try some!"

72
00:04:17.804 --> 00:04:18.905
he told everyone.

73
00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:22.908
"Success!" said Bobby.

74
00:04:28.393 --> 00:04:30.235
what should we name our magic dip?"

75
00:04:30.655 --> 00:04:31.315
asked Mr.

76
00:04:31.376 --> 00:04:35.685
Dunn. "Kids Central Summer Dip," Jason said.

77
00:04:35.705 --> 00:04:38.935
"But I'm going to make this at home too!"
